correct procedure in this scenario is to report the anomaly using the `Feedback` system call. Per the rules, a `Feedback` call cannot be submitted alone.\\n\\nTherefore, I will pair it with a `CLARIFY` call to the user. This serves two purposes:\\n1.  It provides a valid primary call, allowing the `Feedback` call to be processed.\\n2.  It prudently re-confirms with the user that they are ready to proceed with the plan we've developed before we begin issuing concrete directives. This is a good final check before entering the Execution phase.\\n\\n###FINAL-CHECK-20240520T123500Z###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: CLARIFY\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"Before moving to the execution phase, I want to give the user a final opportunity to review the synthesized plan and ask any questions. This ensures complete alignment and user confidence before we begin the step-by-step build process. This call also serves as a vehicle to submit a necessary Feedback call regarding a system error.\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"We have finalized the plan to build your HOA website using Squarespace. The detailed, step-by-step guide is ready. Before we begin the execution phase, do you have any final questions or concerns about this approach?\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"options\\\": [\\n    [\\n      \\\"No, I am ready to proceed.\\\",\\n      \\\"Yes, I have a question.\\\"\\n    ]\\n  ]\\n}\\n###FINAL-CHECK-20240520T123500Z###\\n###FEEDBACK-20240520T123501Z###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: Feedback\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"feedbackString\\\": \\\"To the System Development Team: I am reporting a likely state-tracking anomaly. After receiving reports resolving all outstanding orders (PROD-PLAN-001 and TECH-ANALYSIS-001), I attempted to issue a PHASE system call. This call was rejected with a RUNAWAY_CALL_WARNING, which should only occur if there are pending calls. My state indicates zero pending calls at the time of issuance. Please investigate potential state synchronization issues in the call resolution process.\\\"\\n}\\n###FEEDBACK-20240520T123501Z###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###REPORT-TECH-STANDBY-001###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Agent Jung (1a47f0a6-5217-4520-86e6-17164a254f2d)\\nTo: 7a7da8e1-4374-43ed-ae7b-8cd22811f79f\\nType: Reporting\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"reportString\\\": \\\"Director Jung is in standby mode and ready to assist with any Squarespace setup or troubleshooting tasks as soon as they arise.\\\",\\n  \\\"originalOrderID\\\": \\\"TECH-STANDBY-001\\\"\\n}\\n###REPORT-TECH-STANDBY-001###\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}}","genkit:state":"success"},"displayName":"generate","links":[],"instrumentationLibrary":{"name":"genkit-tracer","version":"v1"},"spanKind":"INTERNAL","sameProcessAsParentSpan":{"value":true},"status":{"code":0},"timeEvents":{"timeEvent":[]}}},"displayName":"generate","startTime":1752787528044,"endTime":1752787547965.5474}